Package: nomologR
Type: Package
Title: Guided Scale Development and Construct Validation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Joshua", "Uhalt",
      email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an evidence-guided workflow for empirical scale development
    and construct validation. The package is designed to help researchers examine
    item performance, dimensionality, measurement models, reliability, convergent
    and discriminant evidence, measurement invariance, and theory-specified
    nomological networks. It emphasizes transparent diagnostics, reproducible
    decision logging, and teaching-oriented guidance rather than automatic item
    deletion or binary declarations that a measure is valid.
